{
  "sources": {
    "ta35": "Tel Aviv Stock Exchange TA-35 constituents as of 2026-11-26, cross-checked against the Bizportal TA-35 composition page dated 26/11/2026 (35 names), Finsights (updated 2026-11-06, source: TASE composition lists; last reconstitution 06-11-2026: Doral and El Al entered, Shufersal exited), and whichindex.com members as of 2026-11-25 (tickers from TASE TA-35 components). Yahoo Finance symbols use the .TA suffix. The TASE listing of Palo Alto Networks uses ticker CYBR (Yahoo: CYBR.TA), not PANW.TA; confirmed by company/TASE announcements of the 23.2.2026 dual listing under CYBR and Yahoo Finance search (CYBR.TA, TLV). NASDAQ PANW remains in the S&P 100 group.",
    "sp100": "S&P 100 components as of 2026-09-21 from the Wikipedia S&P 100 components table, cited there to the iShares S&P 100 ETF (OEF). 101 tickers because Alphabet has GOOGL and GOOG. Yahoo Finance uses BRK-B for Berkshire Hathaway Class B (Wikipedia lists BRK.B).",
    "banks": "The five major Israeli banks requested for the picker, all of which are also TA-35 constituents: LUMI, POLI, DSCT, MZTF, FIBI (.TA).",
    "us_etfs": "Broad US ETF universe (~300) for the prices.json cache: the largest AUM equity, bond, international, sector, dividend, commodity, real-estate, thematic, leveraged, and crypto ETFs commonly held by retail investors, including IBIT, FBTC, ETHA, SPY, QQQ, VOO, VTI, TQQQ and SOXL. Compiled 2026-11-26 from standard issuer families (SPDR, iShares, Vanguard, Invesco, Schwab, Direxion, ProShares, ARK, VanEck, Grayscale). This is a speed cache; any ticker a user enters is still fetched on demand or queued for the next Actions run.",
    "crypto": "Major cryptocurrencies as Yahoo Finance symbols (CODE-USD). Live browser quotes also come from CoinGecko, Binance and Coinbase, which were verified to send Access-Control-Allow-Origin: * without an API key.",
    "tase_etfs": "Israeli ETFs and funds are not hardcoded here with guessed tickers. They are resolved from tase_securities.json (Wikidata list + ISIN-derived TASE security numbers) and from extra_tickers.json / on-demand quotes.",
    "fx": " Extended 2026-11-26 with GBP, JPY, AUD, CAD, CHF and CNY pairs versus USD/ILS/EUR.",
    "mutual_funds": "Israeli mutual funds (קרנות נאמנות) by TASE security number (מספר נייר). Daily purchase/redemption prices are not on Yahoo. The Actions job tries Maya first (https://mayaapi.tase.co.il/api/fund/details?fundId={id}, header X-Maya-With: allow). Verified 2026-11-26: the public page https://maya.tase.co.il/fund/{id} returns 200 but is an empty SPA shell; the JSON API timed out behind Incapsula from this environment. Fallback (verified the same day): Fair public fund pages embed ng-state JSON with sellPrice/buyPrice in agorot and factor 100 (divide by 100 for ILS). Official TASE Data Hub / most tase.co.il APIs returned HTTP 403 without a key. Seed funds: 5133236, 5131925, 5140504, 5136262, 5129283, 5124805."
  },
